# ==============================================================================
# SHIVKRUPA TRADING COMPANY - ENVIRONMENT TEMPLATE (.env.example)
# ==============================================================================
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your actual Supabase credentials:
# 1. Supabase Project URL (e.g. https://your-project-ref.supabase.co)
# 2. Supabase Anon Public Key (starts with eyJhbGciOi...)
